<title>UK: Baird pretax, pre-excep profits rises.</title>
<headline>Baird pretax, pre-excep profits rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December, 1996 (million</p>
<p>stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		    14.3	     vs     11.6</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)     9.35	    vs	9.35</p>
<p> Pretax			   25.1	     vs     20.1</p>
<p> Turnover			667.2	     vs    671.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The pretax profit and earnings per share are before taking exceptional charges into account. The company suffered a pre-tax, postexceptional loss of 6.0 million stg and reported a negative EPS post exceptional items of -6.7 pence per share.</p>
<p>Full company name - Baird (William) Plc.</p>
</text>
